{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"Dear Sonny\nI apologize for my sudden collapse upon the discovery that the infernal contract I held belong to the King of Baator himself. \n\nSo, I took it upon my self to research the dilemma. Such a curse is considered by almost every author to be catastrophic on a personal level to the person undertaking the undoing of it.\n\nHowever, I did uncover the account of one Saint Simone Le'Mont, a blood hunter of the Gnerman empire. Saint Simone is said to have had an  unbearable beauty as a result of time spent training under the Coatyl God Jazirian. Jazirian, they say, was Asamodeous' brother who knew the King of Hell's true name. The secret name that could hold power over him. \n\nThis is the most I have been able to uncover.\n\nSincerely \nClover.","created_at":"2021-07-27T00:32:17.373000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-27T00:33:10.479000Z","id":"869376615505870888","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
